Yannn Agent adapts (shortens and rewrites) instructions from these MIT-licensed projects:

- Superpowers, Copyright (c) Jesse Vincent. https://github.com/obra/superpowers
  skills/brainstorm (look before asking, one question at a time, approaches),
  agents/reproducer.md (root cause before fix), agents/worker.md (evidence before
  claims, tdd flag)

- Matt Pocock's skills, Copyright (c) 2026 Matt Pocock. https://github.com/mattpocock/skills
  skills/grill (design tree, frontier rounds, recommended answers)

- andrej-karpathy-skills, forrestchang. https://github.com/forrestchang/andrej-karpathy-skills
  skills/brainstorm and skills/grill (think before coding), agents/worker.md (surgical
  changes), skills/plan (goal-driven checks)

Listed in this marketplace and installed from their own repositories, not bundled:
- ponytail (MIT), Dietrich Gebert. https://github.com/DietrichGebert/ponytail
  Required dependency.
- taste-skill (MIT), leonxlnx. https://github.com/Leonxlnx/taste-skill
  Optional, for landing pages.

Called at runtime if the user installs it:
- graphify (MIT). https://github.com/safishamsi/graphify
